# game/sean12202024.rpy:121
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0e96abb2:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I just sit on my bed for a moment."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我在床上静坐了一会儿。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:122
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9e9e7576:

    # nulln "The weight of yesterday's investigation settled in my mind. A filled hotel with no one in it."
    nulln "昨天调查的重担沉在我心里。一家住满人的旅馆，里面却空无一人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:123
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4a110d63:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet2 "Artificial eyes that captured their existence, yet no one to remember them. Artifacts left behind uncovered by archeologists that live in their same generation."
    nulln sideSean Quiet2 "人造之眼捕捉到了他们的存在，却没有活人记得他们；与他们同时代的考古学家，发掘出了被其遗留下的文物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:124
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_127e6a7c:

    # nulln "And a hole that swallowed a chunk of the world I'm forced to call home."
    nulln "还有一个大洞，吞没了我被迫称为家的世界的一部分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:125
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_45418277:

    # nulln "All kept in those walls."
    nulln "全都保存在那些墙壁里。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:126
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1129b32e:

    # nulln "Like a museum during the apocalypse dedicated to those who died in it."
    nulln "彷佛末日时期为了死去之人而存在的博物馆。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:127
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0b68d251:

    # nulln "Hopefully those people aren't dead."
    nulln "希望那些人还活着。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:130
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_871abf7e:

    # nulln sideSean Scared2 "I didn't even look in all the rooms I was supposed to. Yet I knew they had people in them."
    nulln sideSean Scared2 "我甚至没有检查所有该看的房间。不过我知道里面有人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:131
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3eb2fb6d:

    # nulln "I was even drawn to that bathroom, despite the feeling like I should leave it be."
    nulln "我还被那间浴室吸引住了，哪怕知道自己不该去管。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:133
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ff68e91:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Sad2 "Coming back home, in general, was strange."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Sad2 "回家的感觉，总的来说，很奇怪。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:135
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2e649d93:

    # nulln "Rocco lets Arthur stay at his apartment, then he has me drive him home to his shitty parents."
    nulln "Rocco让Arthur住他的公寓，却又要我载他回到他糟糕的父母所在的家。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:136
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_775b41e6:

    # nulln sideSean Concerned "Was the apartment some kind of secret? I feel like that would be something he'd tell us to shut up about."
    nulln sideSean Concerned "那间公寓是要保密的吗？感觉他会要我们对这闭口不提。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:137
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3906385a:

    # nulln "The two beds there were also strange. Sure he could probably afford the extra, but why would he need it?"
    nulln "那里有两张床也很怪。他是能多买一张，但又是为什么需要呢？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:138
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_62a3b05a:

    # nulln "He was saving for college. An extra bed is the opposite thing he needs."
    nulln "他想存钱好上大学，多买一张床根本是南辕北辙。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:139
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1e41b399:

    # nulln "Maybe he had finally gotten close with someone, and he was embarrassed to tell us?"
    nulln "也许他终于有了对象，却不好意思告诉我们？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:140
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9a0c0947:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "Either way something is up with him."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "无论如何，他肯定另有隐情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:142
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_2:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:144
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_21f7ebf2:

    # nulln "Then there was that walk."
    nulln "然后还有那次散步。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:145
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1a3ee863:

    # nulln sideSean Sad3 "Talking to yourself can really bring out your emotions."
    nulln sideSean Sad3 "自言自语真的很容易带出情绪。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:146
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4b7eef1e:

    # nulln "I feel kinda like an ass for ditching Rocco though. He had been waiting since summer for Arthur and I to return."
    nulln "不过，抛下Rocco让我觉得自己有点过分。他从夏天就一直在等我和Arthur回来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:147
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5e0de12a:

    # nulln "Though now that I think about it, I feel like a dick for ditching Arthur."
    nulln "不过现在想来，抛下Arthur也让我觉得自己很过分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:148
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a68eeb22:

    # nulln sideSean Sad "Rocco was probably warning him about his parents finding out. Trying to make sure he doesn't end up like..."
    nulln sideSean Sad "Rocco大概是在警告他别让父母发现，以免落得像……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:151
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e1e60aaf:

    # nulln sideSean Concerned "Then there was what Arthur found in Rocco's bathroom."
    nulln sideSean Concerned "然后是Arthur在Rocco浴室发现的东西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:152
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_585ebde9:

    # nulln "I know the dog hated wine..."
    nulln "我知道那只狗讨厌酒……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:153
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_33744ee2:

    # nulln sideSean Sad "I wonder if, in his loneliness, he was thinking about Casey."
    nulln sideSean Sad "但我很好奇，他感到寂寞的时候，会不会想起Casey。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:154
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_026cb925:

    # nulln "The day after his funeral, Rocco came to school with bandages wrapped around his forearms, hidden under a long sleeve shirt."
    nulln "葬礼隔天，Rocco来学校时前臂缠着绷带，用长袖衬衫遮着。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:155
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e356c2d4:

    # nulln "To someone just passing by it looked like it was just a shirt under his shirt. That winter was extra cold, so no one batted an eye at the extra layers."
    nulln "在路人眼里看来，只像在衬衫里面多穿了一件衣服。那年冬天特别冷，就算多穿一件也不足为奇。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:156
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6c63773e:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "I was able to get him alone."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "我私下找了他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:157
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c4bcca81:

    # nulln "He told me how it was a moment of weakness."
    nulln "他说我那只是一时的软弱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:158
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0a0a9a26:

    # nulln "He felt so powerless and didn't know what to do."
    nulln "他感到无力，不知道该如何是好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:159
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bca06a71:

    # nulln "He stopped himself because he imagined me crying alone at Casey's grave."
    nulln "他没继续到底，是因为想象到了我独自在Casey墓前哭泣的景象。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:160
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_66839e50:

    # nulln "Casey and I had joked about me being his brother in law,"
    nulln "Casey和我曾经开玩笑说我是他弟夫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:161
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_1:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:167
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_587fd607:

    # centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=10}but to Rocco it wasn't a joke."
    centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=10}然而对Rocco而言，那并不是个玩笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:173
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5193eca1:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet "I sit for a moment longer then decide to get ready for the day."
    narrator sideSean Quiet "我又坐了一会儿，才决定开始准备今天的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:182
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_32c889f1:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "My steps are foreign and stiff. My parent's house is exactly how I remember it, but I feel like I don't know where anything is in it."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我的脚步生疏而僵硬。父母的房子和我记忆中完全一致，我却感觉不知道东西摆在哪里。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:183
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ddfb1020:

    # "The white outside isn't strange for this time of year, but the snow feels unreal."
    "外头的一片白在这个季节很正常，但雪感觉很不真实。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:185
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_156e333d:

    # "I spend most of the time waiting for Rocco on my phone."
    "等Rocco的时候，我大部分时间都在滑手机。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:186
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_de927f44:

    # "Mom and Dad had already left for church.{nw}"
    "妈和爸已经出门去教会了。{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:187
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_37620777:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet2 "Mom and Dad had already left for church.{fast} The last time I went with them the sermon just so happened to be on 'curing homosexuality'."
    narrator sideSean Quiet2 "妈和爸已经出门去教会了。{fast}上次我和他们一起去的时候，讲道内容刚好是「治疗同性恋」。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:188
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9c80cd45:

    # "I know they didn't plan it. It was my idea, and a spur of the moment decision."
    "那当然不是他们安排的。是我一时冲动，自己提出要去的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:189
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a018b736:

    # "I mostly wanted to go and see if I could finally visit Casey's grave."
    "主要是想去看看，是否终于能拜访Casey的墓。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:190
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f9552509:

    # narrator sideSean Sad "The ban still hasn't been lifted."
    narrator sideSean Sad "禁令至今未曾解除。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:202
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_11622970:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "Aside from the few times that Rocco stalls his truck, the drive to the mall is uneventful."
    narrator sideSean Happy "除了Rocco的卡车熄火了几次，去商场的路上无事发生。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:203
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1a328a14:

    # "The parking lot is surprisingly dead even though it's 2:00."
    "停车场出奇冷清，这都已经两点了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:214
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0bc0a275:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Inside the story is mostly the same."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "里面的情况大致相同。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:215
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_01b26ae4:

    # "Shutters are closed over many of the stores. The soft pretzel booth that Casey and I always ate at was empty."
    "许多店面的卷帘都拉上了。我和Casey以前常去吃的软脆饼摊位空无一人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:216
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_14bb1115:

    # "The ceiling tiles were covered in stains, and buckets filled with rain water sat beneath them."
    "天花板的磁砖布满污渍，下面摆着接雨水的水桶。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:219
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3d0ea939:

    # rocco "I don't remember it being this much of a shit hole."
    rocco "我不记得这里有这么破烂。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:222
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_773cf828:

    # arthur "Well the escape room is new. If it's all gunky it's probably for ambience."
    arthur "嗯，密室逃脱倒是新的。如果那边也脏兮兮的，应该会是为了营造气氛。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:225
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0fc2478a:

    # "We meander towards the food court. I Look at the windows of the few open shops."
    "我们漫步走向美食广场。我看着少数还开着的店面橱窗。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:227
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c092171d:

    # "Most are larger brand stores found in every mall. Many are new names that didn't exist ten years ago."
    "大多是每间商场都有的连锁品牌店。很多十年前不存在的新名字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:228
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_52b69635:

    # "We pass by a department store that had been grafted into the mall."
    "我们经过一家被接进商场的百货公司。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:232
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9a464957:

    # "I only gave it a passing glance, but Arthur noticed something and sprinted on in."
    "我只瞥了一眼，但Arthur注意到什么，便冲了进去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:233
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_763b37b4:

    # "I start to follow after the lion, but notice Rocco waiting outside."
    "我正要跟着狮子，却注意到Rocco等在外头。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:236
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_defd65de:

    # sean "You coming?"
    sean "你要来吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:239
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_38578ec8:

    # rocco sideSean Concerned "Nah... I'll, um, just wait outside."
    rocco sideSean Concerned "不了……我，呃，就在外面等。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:248
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7897814b:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "I shrug and walk in after the lion. Immediately, I knew why Rocco waited outside."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我耸耸肩，跟着狮子走进去。立马就知道为什么Rocco要在外面等了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:256
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_46a8acb9:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Holy shit is that you Nora!"
    belle sideSean Neutral "我靠，是你吗，Nora！？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:263
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2823b1a3:

    # "The doe clops up to Arthur and gives him a big hug. The lion squeezes back and Belle lets out a little squeak."
    "母鹿蹄声响亮地走向Arthur，给了他一个大大的拥抱。狮子回抱，让Belle发出一小声惊呼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:268
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b1d45c3b:

    # belle "Damn girl, you're strong! Must be that big ol' sax you lug around."
    belle "天啊姊妹，你力气也太大了！肯定是因为你成天扛着那支大萨克斯风。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:270
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f1d71bc1:

    # belle "Well how've you been? I love this look you got going, it's so fierce!"
    belle "你最近怎么样？我好爱你现在这个造型，超有气势的！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:275
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cf4383f8:

    # arthur sideSean Embarrassed "Heh... Thanks! I umm, well I actually go by Arthur now..."
    arthur sideSean Embarrassed "嘿……谢谢！我，呃，其实现在叫Arthur了……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:279
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0f4c0669:

    # belle "Oh...{nw}"
    belle "喔……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:281
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c5ea3f42:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Oh...{fast} Are you doing that trans thing?"
    belle sideSean Neutral "喔……{fast}你是在做那个变性的事吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:285
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_eeae4622:

    # "Arthur lets out a nervous laugh. I'm about to step in, but don't as Belle continues."
    "Arthur紧张一笑。我原先正要介入，但Belle继续说了下去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:289
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_59b01a09:

    # belle sideSean Angry "Never thought I'd meet a tranny! That's so cool!"
    belle sideSean Angry "从来没想过会遇到变性人！太酷了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:292
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_49a39a07:

    # belle "Oh wait, I shouldn't say that."
    belle "喔对，我不能说这种话。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:295
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5106a239:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "Nah it's cool..."
    arthur sideSean Concerned "没关系啦……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:298
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_44731ed4:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "No, dude it's not cool. I'm sorry."
    belle sideSean Neutral "不行啦，这样不好。对不起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:303
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3c5893b7:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "They both laugh and the tension is eased a bit."
    narrator sideSean Happy "他俩笑了出来，紧张的气氛略有缓解。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:306
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1c96d41f:

    # belle "Nora it's so cool that you're transitioning! Have you thought of a new name?"
    belle "Nora，你在转变也太酷了！想过新名字了吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:310
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a376d043:

    # arthur sideSean Embarrassed "Umm... yeah... I already told you. It's A-Arthur."
    arthur sideSean Embarrassed "呃……嗯……我已经跟你说过了。是A、Arthur。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:314
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_747f7cbc:

    # "Belle facepaws at his comment."
    "他的话令Belle双手捂脸。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:319
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3b37984a:

    # belle sideSean Concerned "I'm sorry. It's-"
    belle sideSean Concerned "对不起。都是——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:323
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9821d1fc:

    # "She points to her head."
    "她指着自己的头。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:326
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_755858bb:

    # belle "My mind."
    belle "我的脑子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:330
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e5c859ef:

    # arthur "Your TBI from... the stairs."
    arthur "你的创伤性脑损伤……因为那个楼梯。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:333
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_836f69fc:

    # "He says the last words with some skepticism in his tone."
    "他说最后几个字时语气带着一点怀疑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:337
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a32bddda:

    # belle "Yeah, I've been on medication from it for a few years, but it's starting to get less effective."
    belle "对，我已经吃了好几年药，但药效开始变差了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:340
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4037733d:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "I'm sorry Nor-... Archer?"
    belle sideSean Neutral "对不起，Nor……Archer？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:343
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3a926e5c:

    # arthur "Arthur... Belle it's ok. I know it's not your fault. Let's just...{nw}"
    arthur "Arthur……没关系啦，Belle。我知道你没有错。我们就……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:346
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8e49caea:

    # arthur sideSean Happy "Arthur... Belle it's ok. I know it's not your fault. Let's just...{fast} What's been going on?"
    arthur sideSean Happy "Arthur……没关系啦，Belle。我知道你没有错。我们就……{fast}你最近怎么样？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:351
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a3c3e035:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Not much. Just kinda making money to stay alive, so I can make more money."
    belle sideSean Neutral "没怎么样。就是赚点钱活下去，好赚更多钱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:353
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_08c53d04:

    # belle "You've seen the hole right?"
    belle "你看过那个洞了吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:356
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ca4404a8:

    # arthur "Yeah, it's freaky."
    arthur "对，超诡异的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:359
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9de9d5df:

    # belle "Tell me about it. There was one night that I was standing at its edge."
    belle "可不是吗。有一晚我站在洞边。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:362
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7186bfa1:

    # belle sideSean Scared "I think I heard something, or saw something. I don't remember."
    belle sideSean Scared "好像听见或看见了什么。记不清楚了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:363
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2249b691:

    # belle "Anyway I just booked it from there back to my parent's house."
    belle "当下我直接冲回父母家了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:368
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5b4e9776:

    # sean sideSean Concerned "You're still in Carthage?"
    sean sideSean Concerned "你还住在迦太基？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:372
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a8520558:

    # belle sideSean Sad2 "Have to. My doc said that I shouldn't live alone, so for now I have to stay with my folks."
    belle sideSean Sad2 "没办法。医生说我不该一个人住，所以暂时得跟家人住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:377
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_317ee1c1:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "Well we're in town for the next month! You can come hang out with us!"
    arthur sideSean Neutral "我们这个月都会在镇上！你可以来找我们玩！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:382
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_146244a5:

    # sean "I, uh... Don't wanna ditch Rocco."
    sean "我，呃……不想抛下Rocco。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:385
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f16f7ad3:

    # belle "It's fine Sean. I've moved on."
    belle "没事，Sean。我已经放下了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:389
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ecc33280:

    # sean "I don't think he has."
    sean "但他恐怕还没。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:393
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_20126dd3:

    # "I point out the glass front. The dog has sat himself on a bench, and is scrolling through his phone."
    "我指着玻璃门外面。狗正坐在长椅上滑手机。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:394
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_459e63b6:

    # "Thankfully he doesn't look up at us. Belle rolls her eyes."
    "幸好他没抬头看我们。Belle翻了个白眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:398
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c0de1e2d:

    # belle sideSean Concerned "We were young, and while I can't forgive him for what he did; I can at least move past it."
    belle sideSean Concerned "我们那时还年轻。我是无法原谅他做的事，但至少可以往前看。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:401
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d767c83c:

    # "My mind reflexively wants to interrogate that part, but I hold myself back."
    "我反射性想追问那部分，不过忍住了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:402
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_77d31d6e:

    # "This isn't the place to be getting into the distant past. Belle's moved on so there's no reason to open scarred wounds."
    "这里不是翻旧帐的地方。Belle已经放下了，没必要再撕开结疤的伤口。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:407
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0f76b689:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "So when do you get off work?"
    arthur sideSean Neutral "那你几点下班？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:412
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_16d00f04:

    # belle "Not until seven. I'll be tired so I think I'm just gonna go home and sleep."
    belle "要到七点。我会很累，大概要直接回家睡觉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:415
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_15525590:

    # arthur "Fair... Well we're doing an escape room at four. Want us to wait around for you?"
    arthur "好吧……我们四点要去密室逃脱。要我们等你吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:420
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_75ffe4d2:

    # belle "Nah it's fine. Nice catching up with you!"
    belle "不用了。很高兴能跟你们叙旧！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:423
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_050aeeee:

    # arthur "Same here!"
    arthur "我也是！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:426
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fc616559:

    # belle "Oh, before I forget again!"
    belle "喔对，趁我还记得！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:429
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_22ce9c58:

    # "She whips out her phone and begins typing."
    "她拿出手机打字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:434
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1a6ee7b4:

    # belle "Artie?"
    belle "Artie？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:437
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_65f6c55a:

    # arthur "Just Arthur please."
    arthur "Arthur就够了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:442
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8a4ff2ae:

    # belle sideSean Happy "Gotcha! Well this will help me remember."
    belle sideSean Happy "行！这能帮我记住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:445
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1fd12eb3:

    # "She taps the side of the case. We all laugh a bit, and then say our goodbyes."
    "她敲了敲手机壳侧边。我们都笑了一下，然后道别。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:446
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0ca60f88:

    # "There's a new found pep in Arthur's step that I've missed seeing. His gait is bouncy and his smile is infectious."
    "Arthur的步伐多了一股我很久没见到的活力，走路轻快，笑容很有感染力。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:466
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_be122ea1:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "We make our way back to our dog friend. His tail's wagging as we approach him."
    narrator sideSean Happy "我们走回狗朋友身边。一靠近，他尾巴就摇个不停。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:469
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1fc35280:

    # rocco "So how's she doin?"
    rocco "所以她怎么样？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:472
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d311e8d7:

    # arthur "Good... Good...{nw}"
    arthur "不错……不错……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:473
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4d54e5b7:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "Good... Good...{fast} Memory thing caused her to dead name me, but I know she doesn't mean anything by it."
    arthur sideSean Neutral "不错……不错……{fast}她因为记忆问题错叫了我的死名，但我知道她不是故意的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:477
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_86a8f991:

    # rocco "Well, we still have an hour and a half till the escape room.{nw}"
    rocco "嗯，离密室逃脱还有一个半小时。{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:479
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f138ba31:

    # rocco "Well, we still have an hour and a half till the escape room.{fast} Lunch?"
    rocco "嗯，离密室逃脱还有一个半小时。{fast}要吃午餐吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:482
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1b87b5e9:

    # sean sideSean Happy "Sure."
    sean sideSean Happy "好啊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:486
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b4ea7ca4:

    # arthur "Please! I am starving!"
    arthur "一定要！我快饿死了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:500
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c3c17f30:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "The food court isn't as empty as the rest of the mall."
    narrator sideSean Happy "美食广场不像其他地方那么空。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:502
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9cd08bf6:

    # "A lion, hairless cat, and crow sit at one table. A hyena, cheetah, dog and raccoon are at another."
    "一张桌子坐着狮子、无毛猫和乌鸦。另一张坐着鬣狗、猎豹、狗和浣熊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:504
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f61736c9:

    # "Along the wall various restaurants sit with employees as dead as the mall. The aromas drifting off of them compete for dominance in my nose."
    "各种餐厅沿墙排列，员工和商场一样死气沉沉。飘出的香气在我鼻子里争夺主导权。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:518
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1911733b:

    # "Rocco walks off, probably to get the aforementioned pizza. I turn to follow him and spot a familiar bat at the counter."
    "Rocco走离，大概是要买之前提过的披萨。我转身跟着他，便看到柜台有位眼熟的蝙蝠。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:523
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_54bb176a:

    # claire "Oh hey guys!"
    claire "你们好啊！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:526
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_86785182:

    # rocco "Sup!"
    rocco "嗨！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:529
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9dad429b:

    # "Rocco's tail begins to wag."
    "Rocco尾巴摇动。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:534
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1e28bdd6:

    # claire "Lake these were the guys I was telling you about."
    claire "Lake，他们就是我跟你提过的人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:537
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a8a40109:

    # "Behind the counter an androgynous hyena stands. Their gray, sauce stained apron, contrasts their neon green hair and gold piercings. They extend a paw out and we shake it."
    "柜台后方站着一只中性气质的鬣狗。沾满酱汁的灰围裙和TA萤光绿的发色与金色穿环形成对比。TA伸出爪子，和我们握手。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:540
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fd6ab1b3:

    # lake "Lake, but Claire already spoiled it. You here to order something, or didja wanna talk to her?"
    lake "我叫Lake，不过Claire刚才先说了。你们是来点餐的，还是想跟她说话？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:543
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9d44af2a:

    # rocco "Just three slices, one meat-lovers, one pepperoni, and one uuh, let's make it two meat lovers."
    rocco "就三片，一片肉多多、一片义式香肠，然后、呃……改成两片肉多多好了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:549
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bd74846f:

    # lake "Commin' up boss."
    lake "马上来，老板。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:555
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f7911e8f:

    # "Lake takes the slices and throws them in the oven to warm up."
    "Lake拿起披萨片丢进烤箱加热。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:559
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b05417e6:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "I was telling Lake and Hailey about the investigation."
    claire sideSean Neutral "我在跟Lake和Hailey讲调查的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:568
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fa9527d8:

    # "As if on queue, a bird walks out from the next door noodle stand,{nw}"
    "恰巧，一只鸟从隔壁拉面摊走出来，{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:570
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5df52673:

    # "As if on queue, a bird walks out from the next door noodle stand,{fast} and gives Claire a peck on the cheek."
    "恰巧，一只鸟从隔壁拉面摊走出来，{fast}在Claire脸颊上啄了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:575
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8581d933:

    # "They look back at us, and then whisper something to Claire. She whispers something back, and the bird turns to look at us."
    "TA回望我们，然后向Claire耳语。对方也回了几句后，鸟转身面向我们。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:580
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0208734d:

    # whomst "H-hello... I'm um... tired-{nw}"
    whomst "你、你们好……我是、呃……好累——{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:583
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c521e1c3:

    # whomst "H-hello... I'm um... tired-{fast} I MEAN{nw}"
    whomst "你、你们好……我是、呃……好累——{fast}{b}我是说{/b}{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:584
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5a98cc7a:

    # hailey "H-hello... I'm um... tired- I MEAN{fast} HAILEY!"
    hailey "你、你们好……我是、呃……好累——{b}我是说{/b}{fast}HAILEY！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:587
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0205febd:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Claire chuckles as Hailey's feathers poof out. Kinda reminds me of myself a few years ago."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "Hailey的羽毛都炸开了，Claire轻笑出声。感觉有点像几年前的我。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:597
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9a648887:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "We introduce ourselves as Lake pulls the pizzas out of the oven. Rocco pays for the slices, and the five of us head over to a table to chat."
    narrator sideSean Happy "Lake在我们自我介绍时将披萨从烤箱拿出。Rocco付了钱后，我们五人走到一张桌边聊天。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:602
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5abd2b94:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We tell Hailey about what we found in the hotel. Well... more like what we didn't find."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我们跟Hailey讲了在旅馆发现的事物。嗯……应该说没找到的事物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:605
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f755ce02:

    # hailey "It is a weird coincidence. And no one's turned up?"
    hailey "这巧合挺诡异的。而且没有人现身？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:608
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4790b832:

    # rocco "Not from what I've heard. Unless someone's keeping me out of the loop."
    rocco "据我所知没有。除非有人把我排除在消息外。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:612
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6e9c7ec9:

    # hailey "Those white eyes were creepy. Do you think they have anything to do with the disappearances?"
    hailey "那些白眼睛好恐怖喔。你们觉得跟失踪案有关吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:616
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ca10e8c2:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "If there's a monster down there I wanna see it!"
    arthur sideSean Concerned "要是底下有怪物，我想看看！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:621
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6104dcae:

    # rocco sideSean Neutral "The moment it spots you it'll probably start running away."
    rocco sideSean Neutral "怕是会被你直接吓跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:626
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fca7a2cd:

    # hailey "You are giving off an intense aura."
    hailey "你散发的气场太强烈了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:630
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7c3404f9:

    # claire "It is weird that it didn't come out."
    claire "它没跑出来还挺怪的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:637
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f348a922:

    # hailey sideSean Happy "It probably sensed you!"
    hailey sideSean Happy "大概是察觉到你了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:640
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_36033a1d:

    # "We all laugh at that."
    "我们都因此笑了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:643
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e344fd39:

    # arthur "Nah I was miles away. Out of town for college."
    arthur "没，我那时在好几英里外。大学不在镇上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:648
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2980abac:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We tell them about our degrees. Rocco gets a little embarrassed being the only one not going to college."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我们聊着学位。Rocco是唯一没上大学的人，显得有些尴尬。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:649
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_17333b13:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Thankfully we don't spend much time on our academics."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "所幸我们没在学业上琢磨太多时间。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:656
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7e1b5498:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "I did my own digging through the files. I still had an hour left after writing my report and nothing better to do."
    claire sideSean Neutral "我自己翻过档案。毕竟写完报告后还剩一小时，也没什么其他事好做的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:659
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d0d9a10e:

    # "Claire paws us her phone with a note document open."
    "Claire把手机推给我们，上面开着笔记文件。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:666
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b4a87dea:

    # claire sideSean Concerned "Rocco do you remember a P.I. or a cop coming in to talk to someone?"
    claire sideSean Concerned "Rocco，你记得有私家侦探或警察来跟人谈话吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:669
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_25b4f964:

    # "The dog looks up at her. By his face alone we know what he's going to say."
    "狗抬头看她。光看他的表情，我们就料他的回答了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:672
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_761589c7:

    # rocco "No one mentioned it."
    rocco "没人提过。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:677
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d9b10e2a:

    # claire "Do you know about a tabby working at the hotel? The employee files I looked at only have names, and I don't plan on breaching privacy any more than that."
    claire "你知道旅馆有只虎斑猫员工吗？我看的员工档案只有名字，我也不打算再进一步侵犯隐私。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:681
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fc478d7d:

    # rocco "You have access to-{nw}"
    rocco "你有权限看——{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:683
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ac3a8b5:

    # rocco sideSean Quiet2 "You have access to-{fast} never mind. No, there isn't a tabby that works at the hotel. I wouldn-"
    rocco sideSean Quiet2 "你有权限看——{fast}算了。没，旅馆没有虎斑猫员工。我不会——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:687
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5cf139d9:

    # "He cuts himself off."
    "他突然停住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:691
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7df958fb:

    # rocco "Fuck this I just want to have a normal day off!"
    rocco "我操，我只不过想好好休个假！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:698
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8ebd6191:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "Sean and I... um... found something."
    arthur sideSean Concerned "Sean和我……呃……有一些发现。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:701
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a1d542e5:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "They look at us. Then Arthur looks at me. I feel myself shrink in the seat."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "他们望了过来，然后Arthur看向我。我在座位上缩了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:705
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e446a1e9:

    # sean "You brought it up..."
    sean "是你提的……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:709
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4a962085:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet2 "Thankfully the deflection works and now everyone is staring at Arthur."
    narrator sideSean Quiet2 "好在转移焦点成功，现在所有人都盯着Arthur。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:713
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ecc2d591:

    # arthur "Well... We checked out Sarah Anderson's room."
    arthur "嗯……我们查了Sarah Anderson的房间。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:715
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_15c98b2a:

    # arthur "I think it was 105?"
    arthur "我记得是105号房？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:717
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0714189a:

    # arthur sideSean Sad "There was a voice recorder in it with some... pretty damning stuff. She said an investigator came by to follow up on her assault report."
    arthur sideSean Sad "里面有一台录音机，录了一些……很操蛋的内容。她说有个调查员来跟进她的性侵案。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:718
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_81e0eb8a:

    # arthur "She didn't remember being assaulted or filing a report."
    arthur "她却不记得自己被性侵过，也不记得报过案。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:719
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_86ce80d9:

    # arthur "When the investigator gave her the name of the assaulter. She didn't know who it was."
    arthur "当调查员告诉她施暴者的名字时，她不知道那是谁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:722
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_29ed5397:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "Great, now everyone's eyes are back on me. I nibble away at my slice of pizza, nodding."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "真棒，大家的目光又回到我身上了。我边啃披萨边点头。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:723
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b73b8740:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Thankfully that's enough of a yes for the group."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "对大伙来说，这就足够表示肯定了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:730
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_95fe1469:

    # rocco "Fuck me."
    rocco "我操。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:737
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d982df44:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "We didn't bring it up yesterday, because it wouldn't be a good idea to have Mr. Bara-Bod approach someone who had just been assaulted."
    arthur sideSean Neutral "我们昨天没提，毕竟让肉壮男接近刚被性侵的人也不太好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:742
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_beb8e25b:

    # "Rocco self-consciously begins looking over his body."
    "Rocco不太自在地打量起自己的身体。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:743
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_eee999ab:

    # "I get close to the crust of my slice, fold the remaining cheese and sauce over it, and begin eating away at the pizza taco."
    "我披萨吃到接近饼皮，把剩下的起司和酱料折起来，当成卷饼吃。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:750
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f164adcf:

    # sean "Plus the cops are already on it."
    sean "而且警察已经在处理了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:754
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_880c365d:

    # narrator sideSean Trauma "Claire, Hailey, and Arthur give me a look. I can't help but slide down in my chair a bit more."
    narrator sideSean Trauma "Claire、Hailey和Arthur瞥了我一眼。我又不禁在椅子上滑低了点。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:757
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6fe42d96:

    # claire "You really think the cops are gonna do anything."
    claire "你真觉得警察会做什么事吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:760
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1e72e833:

    # sean sideSean Embarrassed "No?"
    sean sideSean Embarrassed "不会吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:766
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ad873fb:

    # hailey sideSean Concerned "If anything, they're just gonna let the guy go with a stern talking to."
    hailey sideSean Concerned "顶多也就教训那人一顿后就放他走人了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:769
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0ded5028:

    # "There's a venom to Hailey's words. One that I didn't expect from the shy bird."
    "Hailey语气愤恨。没想到会从这只腼腆的鸟口中听到。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:772
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8218afd5:

    # claire "I wish there was more we can do."
    claire "真希望有更多我们能做的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:778
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1fa7c95e:

    # rocco sideSean Neutral "Sometimes the best thing to do is nothing. People get paid to look into shit like this."
    rocco sideSean Neutral "有时候最好什么都别做。这种事有人会专门拿钱来办的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:779
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b07dcef6:

    # rocco "Having a gang of misfits playing investigator will probably fuck something up."
    rocco "让一群局外人来玩侦探游戏，大概只会帮倒忙。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:782
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c3ca21e0:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "I think that was supposed to make us feel better."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "他这么说，应该是要让我们心理好过一点。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:785
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a6ac1d85:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "The main thing was the investigator and the staff member."
    claire sideSean Neutral "重点是那个调查员和员工。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:787
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_061efc94:

    # claire "The fact that you don't know either of them makes me concerned."
    claire "你们全都不认识，让我很担心。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:790
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fd52569e:

    # claire sideSean Concerned "Is there any way I could convince the three of you and Hank to move out for a bit? At least until this mystery is over."
    claire sideSean Concerned "你们三个和Hank能暂时搬走吗？至少等到这个谜团事件结束。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:794
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_02b4bef6:

    # "We all give Claire a concerned look."
    "我们都担忧地看向Claire。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:797
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_31abf6e0:

    # claire "I know we only met yesterday, but something is wrong with that town."
    claire "我们确实昨天才刚认识，但那个小镇有问题。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:798
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_55a3b202:

    # claire "I'm worried you all are going to go missing and I won't remember."
    claire "我很怕你们都会闹失踪，而我却不记得了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:801
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7e140c46:

    # sean sideSean Neutral "What makes you say that?"
    sean sideSean Neutral "怎么这么说？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:813
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_936a8be7:

    # claire "Remember how we said we ran into someone?"
    claire "还记得我们说有碰到一个人吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:816
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b5dd7587:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "Sure?"
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "那怎么了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:819
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_38290759:

    # claire sideSean Embarrassed "What was their name Sean?"
    claire sideSean Embarrassed "那个人叫什么名字，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:823
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_302da091:

    # "I don't remember, and I think Claire can see that."
    "我不记得了，我想Claire也看得出来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:824
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_da2d8b01:

    # "In fact, now that I think about it, we didn't run into anyone yesterday."
    "事实上，现在想来，我们昨天根本没碰见任何人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:830
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_251747a2:

    # claire sideSean Scared "What was their species Sean?"
    claire sideSean Scared "那个人种族是什么，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:834
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_abe7fd90:

    # "We didn't run into anyone yesterday, and Claire can see it on my face."
    "我们昨天没碰到任何人，Claire从我表情看出来了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:837
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e1d8effb:

    # claire "We wouldn't pay it any mind if we weren't talking about it right now."
    claire "要不是现在在谈这事，我们根本不会去在意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:838
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2967d515:

    # claire "Hell, I wrote it down in my report, and almost erased it because I thought I was lying."
    claire "靠，我都写进了报告里，还差点因为觉得自己在虚假报告而删掉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:839
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_02ca3a7a:

    # claire "We just forgot a person existed, and we didn't pay it a second thought!"
    claire "我们就这样忘了有个人存在过，连想都没多想！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:843
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_035c57ca:

    # "Rocco gives me a sympathetic look."
    "Rocco同情地看了我一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:844
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_951e2717:

    # "We don't say anything and the noise of the food court fills our ears."
    "我们默默无言，美食广场的噪音充斥耳朵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:851
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ee9773f:

    # claire "Remember how you said you ran into someone?"
    claire "还记得你说有碰到一个人吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:854
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b5dd7587_1:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "Sure?"
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "怎么了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:857
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_38290759_1:

    # claire sideSean Embarrassed "What was their name Sean?"
    claire sideSean Embarrassed "那个人叫什么名字，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:863
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_302da091_1:

    # "I don't remember, and I think Claire can see that."
    "我不记得了，我想Claire也看得出来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:864
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_691e1bcd:

    # "In fact, now that I think about it, [hp1stUpper] and I didn't run into anyone yesterday."
    "事实上，现在想来，我和[hp1stUpper]昨天根本没碰见任何人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:870
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_251747a2_1:

    # claire sideSean Scared "What was their species Sean?"
    claire sideSean Scared "那个人种族是什么，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:874
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_abe7fd90_1:

    # "We didn't run into anyone yesterday, and Claire can see it on my face."
    "我们昨天没碰到任何人，Claire从我表情看出来了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:877
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e1d8effb_1:

    # claire "We wouldn't pay it any mind if we weren't talking about it right now."
    claire "要不是现在在谈这事，我们根本不会去在意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:878
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2967d515_1:

    # claire "Hell, I wrote it down in my report, and almost erased it because I thought I was lying."
    claire "靠，我都写进了报告里，还差点因为觉得自己在虚假报告而删掉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:879
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_02ca3a7a_1:

    # claire "We just forgot a person existed, and we didn't pay it a second thought!"
    claire "我们就这样忘了有个人存在过，连想都没多想！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:883
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_035c57ca_1:

    # "Rocco gives me a sympathetic look."
    "Rocco同情地看了我一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:884
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_951e2717_1:

    # "We don't say anything and the noise of the food court fills our ears."
    "我们默默无言，美食广场的噪音充斥耳朵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:891
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ee9773f_1:

    # claire "Remember how you said you ran into someone?"
    claire "还记得你说有碰到一个人吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:894
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b5dd7587_2:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "Sure?"
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "怎么了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:897
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_38290759_2:

    # claire sideSean Embarrassed "What was their name Sean?"
    claire sideSean Embarrassed "那个人叫什么名字，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:901
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_302da091_2:

    # "I don't remember, and I think Claire can see that."
    "我不记得了，我想Claire也看得出来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:902
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9e883099:

    # "In fact, now that I think about it, I didn't run into anyone yesterday."
    "事实上，现在想来，我昨天根本没碰见任何人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:908
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_251747a2_2:

    # claire sideSean Scared "What was their species Sean?"
    claire sideSean Scared "那个人种族是什么，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:912
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_10f3937d:

    # "I didn't run into anyone yesterday, and Claire can see it on my face."
    "我昨天没碰到任何人，Claire从我表情看出来了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:915
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e1d8effb_2:

    # claire "We wouldn't pay it any mind if we weren't talking about it right now."
    claire "要不是现在在谈这事，我们根本不会去在意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:916
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2967d515_2:

    # claire "Hell, I wrote it down in my report, and almost erased it because I thought I was lying."
    claire "靠，我都写进了报告里，还差点因为觉得自己在虚假报告而删掉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:917
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_affe88c5:

    # claire "We just forgot a person existed, and we didn't pay it a second thought."
    claire "我们就这样忘了有个人存在过，连想都没多想。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:921
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_035c57ca_2:

    # "Rocco gives me a sympathetic look."
    "Rocco同情地看了我一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:922
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_951e2717_2:

    # "We don't say anything and the noise of the food court fills our ears."
    "我们默默无言，美食广场的噪音充斥耳朵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:939
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0c587d3d:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "We hurriedly ran to the escape room."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "我们匆忙跑向密室逃脱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:940
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5c102ab8:

    # "It was almost 4:00 and Arthur realized that they wanted us there 15 minutes early to fill out wavers and stuff."
    "都快四点了，Arthur才想到我们得提早十五分钟到场，填免责协议之类的东西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:941
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9b679b27:

    # "Probably get our email and phone numbers so they can sell them."
    "大概是要我们的电子邮件和电话，好拿去卖吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:943
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a4e100a5:

    # "Sliding around the corner we can see its sign. FairView Navigators, what a terrible name for an escape room business."
    "滑过转角，招牌映入眼帘：FairView Navigators。这密室逃脱店的名字还挺烂的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:944
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_244ee780:

    # "No... don't have time to acknowledge that as we sprint to the doors. I know it isn't like missing a flight, but we only have the room until 5."
    "不……我们没时间在意这个了，径直冲向门口。这当然没有错过飞机那么严重，但我们的房间只到五点。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:955
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_27725eff:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Arthur had picked out Password, an escape room about figuring out a Password to some vault door."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "Arthur选了Password，是要找出某种金库门密码的密室逃脱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:957
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a9e9b2a0:

    # "The attendant for the escape room was a black rat with red eyes."
    "密室逃脱的工作人员是一只红眼的黑老鼠。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:958
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_be387c0a:

    # "As we all began filling out the forms for the escape room I could see him sneak in an extra minute of napping."
    "我们填密室逃脱的资料时，他又贪了点睡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:959
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_88e80ba2:

    # "Arthur tapped on the front desk to let him know we're ready."
    "Arthur敲了敲前台，让他知道我们准备好了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:961
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_143d7de5:

    # "He walks us down a hallway of other escape rooms until we're greeted with a fairly modern door and some lockers."
    "他带我们穿过其他密室逃脱房间的走廊，来到一扇相当现代的门和一些置物柜前。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:963
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_48b18e06:

    # whomst "Alright, put your phones and any valuables in the lockers behind me. Have you guys done Password before?"
    whomst "好了，把手机和贵重物品放到我后面的置物柜里吧。你们以前玩过Password吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:965
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a6c17f88:

    # "We shake our heads no, and the rat sighs."
    "我们摇头表示没有，老鼠叹了口气。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:967
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_281e82cb:

    # whomst "For the sake of the room you can call me Thanatos."
    whomst "以这个房间的设定，你们可以叫我Thanatos。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:968
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bd1a2c64:

    # thanatos "You all have won a sweepstakes vacation to the esteemed Hammond estate."
    thanatos "你们靠抽奖赢得了假期，来到尊贵的Hammond庄园。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:969
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bf90eca4:

    # thanatos "It has everything you could need, and a strange vault in its basement."
    thanatos "这里应有尽有，地下室还有一个奇怪的金库。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:971
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1c94598c:

    # "He tries his best to have some energy to the exposition, but we can all tell he wants to get back to sleep."
    "他尽力打起精神解说，但我们都看得出他只想再回去睡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:973
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5de62c56:

    # thanatos "After a few days of staying in the manor you suddenly get sick. Over the next hour it gets worse and worse until you die."
    thanatos "在庄园住了几天后，你们突然生了病。接下来的一小时内，你们病情会越来越严重，最后死掉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:974
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_53757fd8:

    # thanatos "You awake an hour earlier remembering everything that's about to happen to you."
    thanatos "你们提前一小时醒来，还记得即将发生的一切。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:975
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1e61bfd3:

    # thanatos "Something strange is going on in this house, and you have a feeling that the basement's vault has what you need to survive the day."
    thanatos "这间房子里有怪事发生，而你们觉得地下室的金库里，会有什么东西能帮你们撑过这一天。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:977
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8fa9d6af:

    # "He lets out an exhausted sigh."
    "他发出疲惫的叹息。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:979
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6c86be08:

    # thanatos "Once I close the door you'll be locked in the room for the next hour. If you need to go to the bathroom it's down the hall and to the right."
    thanatos "我关上门后，你们会被锁在房间里一小时。如果要上厕所，走廊尽头右转。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:980
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7dbef221:

    # thanatos "In the event of any emergencies, or you need to leave the room for whatever reason just let me know. I'll be listening in so I can come and unlock it for you."
    thanatos "如果发生任何紧急情况，或因故需要离开房间，就跟我说一声。我会听着你们的动静，能帮忙解锁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:981
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_49dcefed:

    # thanatos "I'll also be your source of hints. Walk up to the monitor by the front door and say the phrase 'give me a vision'."
    thanatos "我也会给你们提示。走到前门的萤幕前说「给我一个幻象」。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:982
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0c53068a:

    # thanatos "You have unlimited hints so don't be afraid to use them if you get stuck."
    thanatos "提示是无限的，卡关的时候直接用就行。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:984
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fdaec0f1:

    # "None of us have to pee so we all enter the room. The door makes an audible click as we're locked in the room."
    "没人要上厕所，就全都进了房间。门发出响亮的咔哒声，把我们锁在里面。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1005
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0b61af8e:

    # rocco sideSean Happy "So now what?"
    rocco sideSean Happy "现在要干嘛？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1009
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3cd614fc:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Arthur and I shrug."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "Arthur和我耸耸肩。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1012
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7e8d67c4:

    # sean "We could go get some food. It's like five something."
    sean "可以去吃点东西。现在五点多了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1017
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_12678de7:

    # arthur "Ooh! Let's go to The Howler! I hear they have great wings."
    arthur "喔喔！去Howler吧！听说他们的鸡翅很棒。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1021
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ccc335c2:

    # rocco "Isn't that a bar? If we're going drinking I'm gonna get shit faced."
    rocco "那不是酒吧吗？如果要喝酒，我绝对要喝个烂醉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1022
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0a9907df:

    # rocco "After the week I've had I need something other than Morris's piss water."
    rocco "这整个礼拜的事，让我需要点Morris那泡尿以外的东西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1027
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e1f047a3:

    # arthur "It's not just any bar Rocco. It's got a legendary glory hole."
    arthur "那可不是普通酒吧，Rocco。那里有传说级的荣耀洞喔。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1030
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_85ba5de3:

    # "I could hear the shit eating grin in Arthur's voice. Rocco on the other paw looked interested."
    "我听得出Arthur声音里的奸笑。另一方面，Rocco看起来挺感兴趣的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1031
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7246c913:

    # narrator sideSean Angry "Sure Arthur wasn't lying, but I doubt they're thinking of the same thing."
    narrator sideSean Angry "Arthur是没说谎，但我他们心里想的应该是不同情景。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1032
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_03917ddb:

    # "The lion was clearly lying by omission, and I'm not letting him trap Rocco there."
    "狮子显然是打算误导他，我可不能让Rocco被他拐去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1033
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a653b7a2:

    # "Forcing him to get flirted at all night isn't fair to him."
    "害他被迫整晚被人搭讪也太过分了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1038
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5a63746d:

    # sean sideSean Neutral "It's a gay bar Rocco."
    sean sideSean Neutral "那是间gay吧，Rocco。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1041
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ae6718b9:

    # "His tail instantly stops and I can tell by his posture he's embarrassed. Arthur is cackling."
    "他的尾巴立刻停住，姿势尽显尴尬。Arthur狂笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1042
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c775b9bc:

    # "I get that he was just joking around, but it wasn't funny."
    "我知道他只是开玩笑，但这不好笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1047
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_125123f7:

    # sean sideSean Angry "You know we should respect Rocco's boundaries."
    sean sideSean Angry "我们应该要尊重Rocco的界线。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1050
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_706d57ae:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "The lion stops and I can see Rocco turn his head in admiration."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "狮子僵住了，Rocco则转头投来钦佩的目光。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1053
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a243990e:

    # arthur "S-sorry..."
    arthur "对、对不起……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1057
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_428943ed:

    # "Rocco twirls his keys in his paw."
    "Rocco转着爪中的钥匙。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1060
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1fe73148:

    # rocco "I gotta drive anyway, so I doubt a bar's a good idea for dinner."
    rocco "反正我还得开车，大概不适合去酒吧吃晚餐。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1065
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f0064dfd:

    # arthur sideSean Quiet2 "There's that one barbecue restaurant. What was it, Baxter's?"
    arthur sideSean Quiet2 "还有家烤肉餐厅。叫什么来着，Baxter？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1068
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_48f4a9ad:

    # "Rocco's tail starts wagging again."
    "Rocco的尾巴又开始摇了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1070
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_3:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1077
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5f4c5cf7:

    # nulln "I didn't want to go."
    nulln "我并不想去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1079
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_77ec9af9:

    # nulln "Casey would beg us to eat at Baxter's."
    nulln "以前Casey会求我们去Baxter吃。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1082
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ab59272f:

    # nulln "Every time we went to see a movie or hang out at the mall, we would end our trip there."
    nulln "每次我们去看电影或逛商场，总会在那收尾。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1084
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_281c90a2:

    # nulln "A root beer, pulled pork with onion straws, and extra fries to take home was his order."
    nulln "一杯沙士、手撕猪肉配洋葱丝，再加份薯条外带，就是他的点单。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1085
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c54e8c04:

    # nulln "He never tried anything else on the menu because he already found the perfect item."
    nulln "他从不点菜单上的其他品项，因为他已经有了完美套餐。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1089
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_4:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1100
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1ede7dd7:

    # nulln sideSean Sad "Baxter's was one of the last places we took Casey."
    nulln sideSean Sad "Baxter是我们最后带Casey去的地方之一。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1102
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e9e1c9b1:

    # nulln "When he came back from camp he was... different."
    nulln "他从矫正营回来后就……变了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1104
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fe2837a6:

    # nulln "He would avoid me at school, still get bullied for being gay, and stay in his room."
    nulln "他在学校会避开我、依旧因为是gay而被霸凌、把自己关在房间里。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1105
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5d80d1a6:

    # nulln "Rocco thought that maybe seeing a movie and eating at Baxter's with us would help improve his mood."
    nulln "Rocco觉得，一起看电影后再去Baxter吃饭，兴许能改善他的心情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1117
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8493c307:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "It was the first real time I saw Casey after camp."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "那是矫正营后我第一次真正见到Casey。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1120
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a3e733ea:

    # nulln "His eyes were sunken, his posture closed off, and his clothes no longer fit him."
    nulln "他双眼凹陷、姿势封闭，衣服也不再合身。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1122
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7247379f:

    # nulln "He touched a paw rail once and screamed from the static shock..."
    nulln "他碰了一次扶手，被静电吓到尖叫……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1124
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_587ef5d8:

    # nulln "He avoided rails and opening doors for the rest of the day."
    nulln "然后一整天都避开扶手或开门。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1147
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d344a50e:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "He ordered his usual."
    nvl clear
    nulln "他点了老样子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1149
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6fc2fca4:

    # nulln "I looked over at him and I could see it."
    nulln "我看向他，看得出来："

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1150
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5629ee54:

    # nulln "Only one bite and he wanted to leave."
    nulln "他只吃了一口，就想走了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1151
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_81264c9e:

    # nulln "To be anywhere other than here."
    nulln "只要能离开这里，去哪都好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1152
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4e4af545:

    # nulln "His body had locked up."
    nulln "他的身体僵住了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1153
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b21b19f0:

    # nulln "Arthur and Rocco were talking about the movie."
    nulln "Arthur和Rocco在聊电影。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1154
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9186a830:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "I thought about putting a paw on his, but didn't."
    nvl clear
    nulln "我想过把手搭在他的爪上，但没那么做。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1156
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_af6b5cd3:

    # nulln "I thought giving him space was what he needed."
    nulln "我以为，他需要一点空间。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1157
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6638f76c:

    # nulln "I thought letting him come back to me when he was ready was what he wanted."
    nulln "我以为，他想要等打理好心境再回到我身边。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1158
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5a81efb4:

    # nulln "He needed me..."
    nulln "他需要我……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1165
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6db25f4f:

    # centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=5}and I abandoned him."
    centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=5}我却抛弃了他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1171
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_5:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1198
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_69054c32:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "It had been three years, but Baxter's was as lively as I remember."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "三年过去了，但Baxter还是和记忆中一样热闹。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1209
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d17e251b:

    # nulln "It looked like they had recently finished building a new seating area. Though we were seated in one of the old booths."
    nulln "他们好像最近刚增建了新座位区。不过我们被安排在一个旧卡座上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1210
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e7739055:

    # nulln "Thankfully the old homely style we knew them for was still around."
    nulln "幸好我们熟悉的那种温馨旧风格没变。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1216
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b36f4bdb:

    # nulln "The waitress paws us our menus and takes our drink orders. Rocco orders a coke while Arthur picks a martini. I just get a water."
    nulln "女服务生把菜单递给我们，并给我们点了饮料。Rocco要可乐，Arthur选马丁尼，而我只点了水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1223
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_dbb00e63:

    # nulln "While our waitress gets the drinks I start looking through the menu."
    nulln "女服务生去拿饮料时，我开始看菜单。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1224
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_737ed7e7:

    # nulln "Their burnt ends were always good."
    nulln "他们的焦边肉很不错。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1227
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_35732d13:

    # nulln "I think I used to get the pork chops since there really wasn't anywhere else to get them."
    nulln "我以前好像常点猪排，毕竟没什么其他地方有卖。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1232
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_86979925:

    # nulln sideSean Scared "Rocco liked the grilled chicken sand{cps=5}...{/}wich{cps=5}...{/}"
    nulln sideSean Scared "Rocco喜欢烤鸡三明{cps=5}……{/}治{cps=5}……{/}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1240
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_756a9e27:

    # narrator sideSean Crying2 "I see it."
    narrator sideSean Crying2 "我看到了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1242
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_552b0384:

    # "There in the middle of all the other sandwiches."
    "就在其他三明治当中。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1244
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ba53c43e:

    # "Pulled pork, sweet barbecue sauce, onion straws, extra fries, and a fountain soda."
    "手撕猪肉、甜烤肉酱、洋葱丝、加点薯条，以及一杯汽水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1245
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4c046482:

    # "The Casey."
    "Casey套餐。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1248
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8e2f040c:

    # arthur sideSean Sad "Sean?"
    arthur sideSean Sad "Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1251
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b997f28d:

    # sean "Huh?"
    sean "啊？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1254
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_abd37974:

    # "I look up at their concerned faces."
    "我抬头，看见他们担忧的神情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1255
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_28924f5b:

    # "It's only then that I realize I'm crying."
    "才惊觉自己在哭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1256
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f0c9ca82:

    # "I place the menu down on the table, and try to stammer out a few words."
    "我把菜单放在桌上，试图吐出几个字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1257
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3b5eda77:

    # narrator sideSean Crying2 "My brain has stopped working so I just point to the sandwich."
    narrator sideSean Crying2 "我的脑袋当机了，只能指着那份三明治。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1268
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e7c0fe2a:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Quiet "It was a long ride home."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Quiet "回家的路很漫长。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1270
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_da0e031f:

    # nulln "I didn't say anything."
    nulln "我一语不发。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1278
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_964e597d:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "We said goodbye to Arthur, then I said goodbye to Rocco."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "我们跟Arthur道别后，我再跟Rocco道别。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1284
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d4b01f8e:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "I put the leftover fries in the fridge, trying my best not to wake mom and dad."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "我把剩下的薯条放进冰箱，尽量避免吵醒爸妈。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1285
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ab532a72:

    # nulln "It wasn't late, maybe nine or ten when I got back, but they had work the next day."
    nulln "我回来得不算晚，大概九或十点，但他们明天要上班。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1293
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ec21280c:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I try to fall asleep for the next two hours."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "接下来得两小时，我试着睡觉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1294
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_db5b11fb:

    # nulln "I lay there tossing and turning; trying to find the right position to sleep in."
    nulln "辗转反侧，试着找到适合入睡的姿势。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1295
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d42dbaea:

    # nulln "Hoping that if I just lay still enough my body would shut down so I could get to tomorrow."
    nulln "但愿只要安静躺着，身体就会关机，好让我迎来明天。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1296
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a09d6c20:

    # nulln "It didn't work."
    nulln "没用。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1298
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_53112e91:

    # nulln sideSean Trauma "I still couldn't get my mind off of everything."
    nulln sideSean Trauma "我还是没能把思绪移开这一切。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1300
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_6:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1302
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b5467df0:

    # nulln "My walk through the woods alone."
    nulln "我独自穿过树林的那次散步。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1305
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_329748d5:

    # nulln "My walk with [camp1stUpper] talking about... someone..."
    nulln "我跟[camp1stUpper]散步时谈到……某个人……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1307
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_144dd02c:

    # nulln "Tackling half of the hotel by myself."
    nulln "我一个人处理了半间旅馆。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1308
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_30de7ba5:

    # nulln "I still feel bad that I just marked some of the cards without checking the room."
    nulln "有些房间我没检查就标记了，还是有点过意不去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1310
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_071e5992:

    # nulln "How Arthur kept bringing up that person. Plus the missing people of the hotel."
    nulln "Arthur一直提起那个人，加上旅馆失踪的人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1312
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e0541586:

    # nulln "The missing people of the hotel."
    nulln "旅馆失踪的人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1314
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0ecd40c4:

    # nulln "That conversation with Arthur by the river."
    nulln "和Arthur在河边的那次谈话。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1315
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4792cdd0:

    # nulln "The mall, and Baxter's."
    nulln "商场，还有Baxter。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1316
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_19dc8793:

    # nulln "Everything just felt wrong, and my mind couldn't stop thinking about it."
    nulln "一切都很不对劲，我的思绪停不下来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1317
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9ff821b1:

    # nulln "Usually I could just wallow my way out of situations like this. Spend so much time stewing on what ifs that I tire myself out."
    nulln "通常我都能沉浸其中，反过来脱离这种状况：长时间不断设想，最后就会想累自己。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1318
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a9e5f8cd:

    # nulln "Not this time sadly."
    nulln "只可惜这次不行。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1324
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_7:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1326
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_057d598d:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I decided to throw on my coat and go for a walk."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我决定披上外套出去走走。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1327
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cbc9eb8f:

    # nulln "I wasn't gonna sleep anyway."
    nulln "反正也睡不着。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1328
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_93f15e51:

    # nulln "Soft snow crunches under my pads."
    nulln "柔软的雪被我脚掌踩响。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1329
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_14e2e54b:

    # nulln "The gentle glow of the moon fills the sky as it and the stars dance along the horizon."
    nulln "柔和的月光填满天空，与星星在地平线上共舞。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1330
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a66c55aa:

    # nulln "The white hue of the street lamps guide me along Carthage's crumbling asphalt."
    nulln "街灯的白光引导我走在迦太基破碎的柏油路上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1331
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b78ec752:

    # nulln "Each lamp their own star, far more reachable than the ones Casey and I would dream of."
    nulln "每盏灯都像一颗星星，远比我和Casey曾经的梦想更触手可及。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1333
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_803136a6:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Sad "I missed these nights."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Sad "我很怀念那些夜晚。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1335
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9dcda5b3:

    # nulln "The lonely hour where we would meet."
    nulln "我们幽会的寂寥时刻。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1336
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bb730503:

    # nulln "The world so quiet we could finally hear each other."
    nulln "世界静谧，我们终于得以听见彼此。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1337
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_25271b04:

    # nulln sideSean Happy "We'd dance through our town's cosmos without a care in the world."
    nulln sideSean Happy "我们会在小镇的宇宙中起舞，毫不在意俗世。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1338
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4112d59c:

    # nulln "Holding each other's paws knowing only the stars could see us."
    nulln "牵起彼此的爪，知晓只有星辰看得到我们。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1339
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e5d08273:

    # nulln "Dreaming of the day we could finally do this under the warmth of the sun."
    nulln "梦想着有朝一日，亦能在阳光的温暖下做这些事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1340
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9f7b5457:

    # nulln sideSean Trauma "He used to joke about us being half vampire. The bad half. The half that can't exist in the light."
    nulln sideSean Trauma "他曾开玩笑说我们有一半是吸血鬼。坏的那一半；见不得光的那一半。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1341
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c16e20c2:

    # nulln "The half that has to be invited to a community, never assumed to be a part of it."
    nulln "必须受邀才能进入社群，终归是个异类。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1342
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_21d1b750:

    # nulln sideSean Happy "Thankfully we could still eat garlic, and cross running water."
    nulln sideSean Happy "幸好我们还能吃大蒜，也能横跨流水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1343
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e7464fd3:

    # nulln "We got to keep those parts."
    nulln "我们还保有那些部分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1349
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_8:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1351
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c0210bcc:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I was surprised to find myself back in front of the hole."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我讶异地发现，自己又回到了那个坑前。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1352
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_34c2a6f7:

    # nulln "Even in the dead of night it looked supernaturally dark."
    nulln "即使在深夜，它看起来也暗得超乎自然。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1353
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_41a4f1cb:

    # nulln "A gaping abyss sitting in the middle of nothing."
    nulln "在一片虚无之中张开大口的深渊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1357
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_397348c1:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet "There wasn't any sound, and unlike any of the recordings I saw, there was nothing in it."
    narrator sideSean Quiet "没有任何动静，也不像我看过的那些录影，里面什么都没有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1358
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a7ffd884:

    # "I couldn't see the bottom, but I also didn't feel like pulling out my phone to check if it was still there."
    "深不见底，但我也不想拿出手机确认它是否还在。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1363
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_76fc0171:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Instead I turned my head up hearing the grumblings of an all too familiar husky."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "反之，我抬起头，听见一只再熟悉不过的哈士奇在抱怨。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1367
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2fface20:

    # rocco "Oh shit... What're you doing here?"
    rocco "喔靠……你在这里干嘛？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1371
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8d7f6771:

    # sean "Same thing as you."
    sean "跟你一样。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1375
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ca669db1:

    # "The dog lets out a groan."
    "狗发出一道呻吟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1379
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2ba008ce:

    # rocco "Man, I really shouldn't be out this late."
    rocco "天啊，我真不该这么晚还跑来外头的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1383
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f9a2efba:

    # sean sideSean Concerned "Work right?"
    sean sideSean Concerned "明天要工作？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1386
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7a0e634b:

    # rocco "Bright and early. Nobody showed up today."
    rocco "一大清早就要。今天没人来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1389
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_335da11b:

    # rocco "Hey, have you been getting strange calls?"
    rocco "欸，你最近有接到奇怪的电话吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1392
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3ab22981:

    # sean "No. Why?"
    sean "没有。怎么了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1396
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c33061cc:

    # rocco "I had to turn my phone off."
    rocco "我不得不把手机关了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1397
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_dcfa1f72:

    # rocco "I kept getting bombarded by a number I didn't recognize. Didn't know the voice either."
    rocco "我一直被一个不认识的号码狂轰，声音也不耳熟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1400
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2c2b3a1f:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "You don't think..."
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "你是不是觉得……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1403
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f0f71b4f:

    # "We both look down at the hole."
    "我们两个都低头看着那个坑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1413
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b23abdba:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "Before Rocco could answer, we heard the ghostly sound of an old jazz legend."
    narrator sideSean Happy "Rocco还没回答，就有一段老爵士乐的鬼魅声传来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1414
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7084664b:

    # "I see Rocco lean to look behind me, and I turn to face the same direction."
    "Rocco倾身看向我身后，我也把头转往同一个方向。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1422
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2b7d30f8:

    # "Our lion opens his eyes and stops playing as he sees us."
    "咱们的狮子睁开眼睛，一看到我们就停了下来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1425
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_69ccfaf2:

    # arthur "Yo."
    arthur "哟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1428
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5c869e87:

    # sean "Sup. Can't sleep?"
    sean "嗨。睡不着？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1432
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_42f92f27:

    # arthur "Nah just felt like freezing my pads. You?"
    arthur "没，只是想冰一下脚掌而已。你们呢？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1435
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1b553250:

    # sean sideSean Neutral "Couldn't sleep."
    sean sideSean Neutral "睡不着。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1439
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_78900a91:

    # rocco "Kept getting bugged into working a 16 hour shift tomorrow."
    rocco "一直被逼到明天要上十六小时班。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1442
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_758e2660:

    # "I hear a hiss escape the lion's lips as he lowers his sax."
    "狮子放下萨克斯风时，嘴里漏出一道嘶声。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1447
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_277fe920:

    # sean sidSean Concerned "How're your parents?"
    sean sidSean Concerned "你爸妈怎么样？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1451
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_95cf32a3:

    # arthur "Same ol' same ol'... I came out here so I could finally get some me time."
    arthur "还是老样子……我跑出来就是为了能有点自己的时间。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1454
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a23ed546:

    # "He tugs on his mane. I guess he can't wear it while he's home."
    "他拉了拉自己的鬃毛。在家里恐怕就不能戴了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1456
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8897cc6f:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We all shift our attention back to the hole. It is, as it has been, eerily silent and dark."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我们注意力都转回了那个坑。它一如既往，寂静而黑暗得诡异。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1457
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1eee327e:

    # "The lone rope that descends in is still tied up against a lamp post."
    "那条垂下去的绳子还绑在灯柱上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1461
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_10f661a5:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "So you're thinking what I'm thinking right?"
    arthur sideSean Concerned "你们想的跟我一样吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1465
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3ca4f5d1:

    # rocco "You want to go in there?"
    rocco "你想进去？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1469
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_382038e8:

    # arthur "No Rocco, I wanna go out for snow cones."
    arthur "错，Rocco，我出来是想吃刨冰。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1472
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9e888efc:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "Yes! I mean it leads to the one place we've never been and there's nobody around to stop us!"
    arthur sideSean Neutral "那还用说！这个通向我们没去过的地方，周围还没人能阻止我们！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1476
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8446c918:

    # "We both give him a look."
    "我们两个都看了他一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1480
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_45a7723c:

    # arthur "C'mon, what happened to your sense of adventure."
    arthur "拜托，你们的冒险精神跑哪去了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1483
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_712f4eb5:

    # "The lion begins to make his way to the rope."
    "狮子走向绳子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1487
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4e766d14:

    # rocco sideSean Concerned "You're not seriously going down there."
    rocco sideSean Concerned "你不会真要下去吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1492
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_57f1fcf8:

    # arthur sideSean Embarrassed "What's it look like closet boy!"
    arthur sideSean Embarrassed "不然呢，深柜男！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1497
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_17dd83cd:

    # "Arthur's voice echos out as he descends down. A growl comes out from Rocco's muzzle."
    "Arthur的声音在他下降时回荡。Rocco嘴里发出低吼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1500
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cd4eb721:

    # sean sideSean Concerned "Are you sure you wanna be spelunking with your bari?"
    sean sideSean Concerned "你确定要带着萨克斯风去探窟？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1508
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6d1d326c:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "I'm not gonna leave it outside for someone to snatch and pawn off."
    arthur sideSean Neutral "可不能留在外头被人偷去当掉了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1511
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3368f064:

    # arthur "C'mon it'll be a quick five minute adventure!"
    arthur "好嘛，就小小冒险个五分钟！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1516
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_24b660e5:

    # "I look over to Rocco who has a paw in his face."
    "我看向Rocco，他一爪捂着脸。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1520
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b6cfa6a9:

    # sean sideSean Embarrassed "I mean we can't let him go down there alone..."
    sean sideSean Embarrassed "总不能让他一个人下去吧……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1523
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_42114820:

    # rocco "Yeah..."
    rocco "是啊……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1546
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bb9cac38:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We both begin our descent."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我们两个开始下降。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1547
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_014fdbbd:

    # "I try my best to avoid getting rope burn as I slide down after Rocco. Arthur is waiting for us with a shit eating grin on his face."
    "我尽量不让手被绳子擦伤，跟随Rocco滑下去。Arthur一脸得意地等着我们。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1549
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4f3cd34b:

    # "There's various computers covered in snow, spot lights pointed towards the center, cables running around the unstable ground, and a ladder tall enough to be propped up to get out."
    "这里有被雪覆盖的各种电脑、朝向中心的聚光灯、蜿蜒在不稳定的地面上的电缆，还有一架高到足以爬出去的梯子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1550
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9fab8faf:

    # "It's strange, the hole feels a lot shorter than those videos. It was so dark looking in, but I can see still see the roofs of Main Street."
    "奇怪，这天坑感觉比那些影片里浅很多。从上方看进来很黑，但从这还看得到主大街建筑的屋顶。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1555
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ce9106a9:

    # "I see Arthur and Rocco go pale."
    "只见Arthur和Rocco脸色发白。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1556
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5fe19f98:

    # narrator sideSean Scared "I follow the direction of their gaze and see it."
    narrator sideSean Scared "我顺着他们的目光看去，然后看见了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1557
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f7685d1c:

    # "A massive cave leading further under the town."
    "一个通向小镇深处的巨大洞穴。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1558
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1588f8e7:

    # "It's impossible to see into it, and shining the light from my phone doesn't help."
    "里面一片漆黑，连手机灯光也没用。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1561
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_968fca65:

    # rocco "Nope, I already know what you're gonna say, and no!"
    rocco "不行，我已经知道你要说什么了，不行！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1565
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_50df427f:

    # arthur "Oh c'mon."
    arthur "吼，拜托。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1570
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_364b93d7:

    # rocco sideSean Concerned "You had your little adventure coming down here now lets go."
    rocco sideSean Concerned "你已经下来小小冒险过了，该走了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1577
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8f23e195:

    # "Arthur immediately starts walking to the cave."
    "Arthur直接走向洞穴。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1581
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f92d4c62:

    # rocco "Arthur!"
    rocco "Arthur！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1584
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fe7f97d8:

    # "Rocco and I follow after him."
    "Rocco和我跟着他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1587
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cea9740a:

    # arthur sideSean Scared "I thought I heard someone."
    arthur sideSean Scared "我好像听见有人在。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1590
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_8274a92f:

    # rocco "Arthur there is no one stupid enough to go into that cave. Now let's go!"
    rocco "Arthur，才没人会蠢到进那个洞咧。快离开！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1597
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1d3f17c8:

    # "Arthur continues to walk into the cave."
    "Arthur继续走进洞穴。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1600
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0e72e4d7:

    # rocco "Sean, a little help?"
    rocco "Sean，帮个忙？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1603
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_018043c8:

    # sean sideSean Quiet "No... I heard it too?"
    sean sideSean Quiet "不对……我好像也听到了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1606
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_852e81c8:

    # "Curiosity takes the better of me and I join the lion."
    "我在好奇心驱使下，也加入了狮子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1608
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_e6779a39:

    # "I hear Rocco groan, but he follows us anyway."
    "Rocco一阵呻吟，但还是跟在我们身后。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1627
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_bf7092a6:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Our footsteps echo against the old stone. The ground is a mixture of small rocks, mud, and clay."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "我们的脚步声在古老的石头间回荡。地面是小石头、泥土和黏土的混合物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1628
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_353177e8:

    # "There are a few beams erected to hold up the tunnel, but they become fewer and fewer the deeper we go in."
    "有几根梁柱支撑着隧道，但越往深处就越少。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1632
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_627257fa:

    # "As we get deeper the world gets darker."
    "我们越是深入，世界就越黑暗。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1645
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4d764a1d:

    # narrator sideSeanHole Concerned "The walls that we once saw on the edge of our phone's flashlight become black voids."
    narrator sideSeanHole Concerned "原本在手机灯光尽头可见的墙壁，变成了漆黑的虚空。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1646
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_99e7c34a:

    # "Our footsteps go from echoes to pure silence."
    "脚步声转为彻底的寂静。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1647
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_06bc17f4:

    # "I spin around to get a sense of the world and come up blank."
    "我转一圈身子，想感受这个世界，却只有一片空白。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1648
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_3d299ba2:

    # narrator Scared "It didn't feel like the walls were diverging away from us, but no matter where my light shined it never showed anything."
    narrator Scared "墙壁感觉并没有偏离我们，但无论我把光朝向哪里，都什么也照不出来。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1652
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_392df5fc:

    # sean "Uuuh guys? Do you see the wall?"
    sean "呃呃，大伙们？你们看得到墙壁吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1657
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_aec538f3:

    # "Arthur lets out a laugh, putting a paw against the void, leaning on something."
    "Arthur笑了出来，一爪搭上虚空，好似在靠着什么。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1660
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7fce29dc:

    # arthur Neutral "It's right next to us, dummy."
    arthur Neutral "就在我们旁边啊，小笨蛋。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1664
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_30d50d54:

    # sean "Yeah but do you see it?"
    sean "对，但你看得到吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1667
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2342d651:

    # "Rocco and I both shine out lights at the lion."
    "Rocco和我都把光照向狮子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1669
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0f5ea1f9:

    # "There was something he was leaning on, but to us it just looked like he was leaning on the air."
    "他确实靠着什么，但在我们看来，就像靠在空气上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1670
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6ac3b962:

    # "Like how travelers to Europa would use forced perspective to hold up the Tower of Pisa."
    "好比去欧洲的旅人会用透视展现出托住了比萨斜塔那样。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1671
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0e4c130c:

    # "He was doing the same without trying."
    "他无心之中也做到了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1675
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2f227458:

    # arthur Concerned "Freaky!"
    arthur Concerned "好恐怖喔！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1679
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_aff1ce8a:

    # "He chuckled out. Rocco didn't look as impressed."
    "他笑了出来。Rocco却不以为意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1682
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_da521309:

    # rocco Neutral "Ok, you had your fun, let's get the fuck out of here."
    rocco Neutral "好了，你玩够了，快他妈离开这里吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1683
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f3c02e2f:

    # rocco "I gotta bad feeling about this place."
    rocco "这里给我一种不祥的感觉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1687
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_35c8974d:

    # arthur "{i}Booo.{i}"
    arthur "{i}喔呜～{i}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1691
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ae01e6a0:

    # "The three of us turned to leave."
    "我们三个转身要离开。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1694
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2c6aa275:

    # arthur Happy "Guess it was fun while it lasted."
    arthur Happy "还挺有意思的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1695
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c146a7e7:

    # arthur "Wanna see if we can get in during the day? Maybe the light will reach deeper in and we can see more!"
    arthur "想不想白天再进来试试？也许光线能照得更深，看得到更多！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1699
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2c3803ae:

    # rocco "I got work. Please do not get trapped in the spooky hole without me."
    rocco "我要上班。请别趁我不在的时候被困在这诡异的坑里。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1703
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_af54f99b:

    # arthur "Why not? Think Sean and I can't handle ourselves?"
    arthur "为什么不行？你觉得Sean和我保护不了自己吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1710
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_b28eb3e7:

    # rocco Neutral "Yes. I figure you'd piss off any cave monsters, and Sean would get bodied trying to calm them down."
    rocco Neutral "对。你肯定会惹毛坑里的任何怪物，然后Sean会为了安抚它们被辗过去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1714
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_18183140:

    # "Arthur belts out a laugh."
    "Arthur大笑出声。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1717
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_72997d21:

    # sean "Really?"
    sean "你认真？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1720
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2ad9ff27:

    # arthur "Dude, I can see it turning you into a pancake!"
    arthur "老兄，我都想象得出你被辗成薄饼的样子了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1724
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_70491747:

    # narrator Angry "The lion continues to chuckle as I glare at the dog."
    narrator Angry "狮子继续笑着，我则瞪着狗。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1727
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_2dcc633b:

    # rocco "Just trying to lighten the mood man."
    rocco "我只是想缓和一下气氛啦，兄弟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1732
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c713a15b:

    # rocco Neutral "Yes. I figure you'd piss off any cave monster, or Sean would want to fuck it."
    rocco Neutral "对。你肯定会惹毛坑里的任何怪物，或者Sean会想跟它搞。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1736
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_18183140_1:

    # "Arthur belts out a laugh."
    "Arthur大笑出声。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1739
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cc5f9461:

    # sean Angry "Dude what the fuck?"
    sean Angry "你说这什么鬼话啊？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1742
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5ceb9c41:

    # arthur "N-no dude! Ha! He got you hook, line, and sinker!"
    arthur "不、不是吧老兄！哈！你整个被他呛爆了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1745
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ab02206e:

    # "The lion continues to chuckle as I glare at the dog."
    "狮子继续笑着，我则瞪着狗。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1749
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_18ec833d:

    # rocco "Just trying to lighten the mood, gay boy."
    rocco "我只是想缓和一下气氛，小gay炮。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1754
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_81c65f2d:

    # arthur Neutral "Heh, nah, but seriously my sax is getting heavy. I'm ready to go home."
    arthur Neutral "呵，不过说真的，我快扛不住萨克斯风了。也该回家了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1758
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d409bb63:

    # rocco "How're you plannin' on getting out of here with that?"
    rocco "你打算怎么扛着那个爬出去？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1762
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9a866e6f:

    # arthur "Originally I wanted to tie it to the rope and pray I don't ding it on the way up. But there's the ladder."
    arthur "我本来是想绑在绳子上，然后祈祷拉上去时别撞到。不过这里有梯子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1767
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_95d2e228:

    # rocco "Fair. You ever climb a rope before?"
    rocco "行。你以前爬过绳子吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1770
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4ab4f994:

    # arthur "Nah, have you?"
    arthur "没有，你呢？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1773
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_31b8c3e8:

    # rocco "Nope."
    rocco "没有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1776
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9d9a3912:

    # arthur "It can't be that hard."
    arthur "应该没那么难吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1779
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_88717931:

    # "We both stop and give him a look."
    "我们两个停下来看了他一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1783
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_be22de3f:

    # arthur "What?"
    arthur "怎么了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1787
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d817db60:

    # rocco "There is no way your noodle arms can climb up a rope."
    rocco "你手臂那么细，绝对爬不了绳子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1792
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_822f593f:

    # sean "I don't think its only upper body strength, but yeah no way."
    sean "应该不是只靠上半身啦，不过没错，没可能的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1796
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0775b7fc:

    # narrator Embarrassed "Arthur rolls his eyes, then his sleeve. He flexes his arm and it's surprisingly toned."
    narrator Embarrassed "Arthur翻了个白眼，然后卷起袖子。他弯起手臂，意外结实。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1799
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0008628b:

    # sean Happy "Damn!"
    sean Happy "哇靠！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1803
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ad510c06:

    # arthur "How do you think I'm able to lug this thing around campus every Saturday? This guy's got guns!"
    arthur "你以为我是怎么每个星期六在校园扛着这东西的？我可壮了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1808
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c85f85f1:

    # rocco Neutral "Careful, Sean's into the...{nw}"
    rocco Neutral "你要小心了，Sean喜欢……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1810
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_584fa510:

    # rocco "Careful, Sean's into the...{fast} uuh... Baro type."
    rocco "你要小心了，Sean喜欢……{fast}呃……露壮型的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1814
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_035b2c9f:

    # sean "Really..."
    sean "我靠……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1818
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d854dd6a:

    # "Arthur slows down to whisper to me."
    "Arthur放慢脚步对我耳语。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1822
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_779772db:

    # arthur "Does he mean bara?"
    arthur "他是指肉壮吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1825
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_02859be9:

    # sean "Yes."
    sean "对。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1829
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c221b556:

    # arthur "I know a guy."
    arthur "我认识一个人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1832
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4d5ceeb3:

    # "He has a shit eating grin on his face."
    "他脸上挂着得意的奸笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1837
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9c4a0a9f:

    # sean Angry "Will you both stop trying to hook me up with your gay friends!"
    sean Angry "你们两个能不能别再想把撮合我和你们的同志朋友了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1840
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5c975168:

    # "Arthur and Rocco laugh at me."
    "Arthur和Rocco都在笑我。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1845
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_cfb57227:

    # "Rocco clears his throat."
    "Rocco清了清嗓子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1850
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_516ccf6a:

    # rocco Neutral "So, I think I'm probably gonna be working overtime for the next month."
    rocco Neutral "嗯，我接下来一个月恐怕都得加班了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1854
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4fff63f8:

    # arthur Concerned "Why?"
    arthur Concerned "为什么？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1858
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_d9d3e5ed:

    # rocco "No one's been showing up."
    rocco "都没人来上班。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1859
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_dd562244:

    # rocco "Remember before we went in? Kept getting calls from the hotel that no one was there."
    rocco "还记得我们过去之前吗？旅馆一直打来说没人在。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1862
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_67929811:

    # sean Neutral "Shouldn't they hire more people?"
    sean Neutral "他们不该多雇点人吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1866
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_64689fad:

    # rocco "I bet we're not bringing in enough to justify it."
    rocco "我们肯定赚得不够多，没理由再多雇人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1867
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_f78ee5b0:

    # rocco "I swear, some days I feel like I'm the only one there."
    rocco "有几天我都觉得就只有我一个人在。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1870
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_5e9787c3:

    # arthur "Could you pull double duty with a janitor?"
    arthur "你能跟清洁工兼职轮班吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1874
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_71c6961a:

    # rocco "What do you think? I'm the janitor, manager, and front desk boy all wrapped up into one."
    rocco "你觉得呢？我是清洁工、经理和柜台全包了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1877
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_adb43e6c:

    # sean Angry "You should call corporate when we get back. This is honestly ridiculous."
    sean Angry "我们回去后，你应该去找总部才对。这也太扯了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1881
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_7631d44a:

    # rocco "I should quit is what I should do. I'm tired of putting up with their bs."
    rocco "我应该辞职才对。我已经受够这一切了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1886
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_9773874a:

    # arthur Concerned "Hey, we've been walking way too long."
    arthur Concerned "欸，我们也走太久了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1889
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_304f8ffe:

    # "We both look at him."
    "我们两个看向他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1890
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_986045cc:

    # "I swing my flashlight around and sure enough the walls haven't come back."
    "我用手电筒扫了一圈，果然还是没看到墙壁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1891
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_52c0ad2e:

    # "We're still surrounded in darkness. I even shine it at the ground, and see nothing."
    "我们依旧被黑暗包围。哪怕我照向地面，也什么都看不到。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1894
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_80d02489:

    # rocco "I swore we were walking in a straight line."
    rocco "我们肯定直着走的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1897
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1f6da24d:

    # rocco Neutral "Don't!"
    rocco Neutral "你别！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1900
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_6cdca80b:

    # "He catches Arthur before he could make a pun about one of our sexualities."
    "在Arthur讲出和性取向有关的双关语前，他就先行拦住了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1903
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_1448d3e5:

    # narrator Concerned "It is weird, we should've seen the entrance by now, but there's nothing."
    narrator Concerned "确实不对劲，现在应该已经要能看到入口了，却什么都没有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1904
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_4897b62e:

    # "Not even a faint glimmer of outside light."
    "甚至没有一丝外界的光线。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1907
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_a5e080cd:

    # sean "What do we do? Call for help?"
    sean "怎么办？要求救吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1910
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_c7080ed9:

    # rocco "Sean we're probably far enough underground that there'll be no signal."
    rocco "Sean，这里大概已经深到没讯号了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1915
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_0cf9d1fd:

    # narrator Happy "I open my phone to see a full set of bars and 4g LTE."
    narrator Happy "我打开手机，看到满格讯号和4G LTE。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1916
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_ae534ecf:

    # "I turn to show the bars to Rocco, who groans in response."
    "我转身把讯号格数秀给Rocco看，令他一阵呻吟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1918
translate Schinese sean12202024kc_fa48c238:

    # narrator Neutral "So who should I call?"
    narrator Neutral "那我该打给谁？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1931
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_0dc07980:

    # narrator Quiet "The others seem to have the same luck as me."
    narrator Quiet "其他人似乎跟我一样倒楣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1932
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_92423a07:

    # "Arthur is hyperventilating as he tries to explain our situation."
    "Arthur在试图解释我们的情况时过度呼吸。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1933
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_bb906ae6:

    # "Rocco is cursing someone out."
    "Rocco破口大骂。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1935
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_eb3aa5c4:

    # "I let them finish their conversations just numb to what I experienced."
    "我让他们讲完电话，对自己经历的一切已经麻木不仁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1937
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_ed0c087a:

    # "Rocco hangs up his call, and is about to spike his phone to the ground."
    "Rocco挂断电话，想把手机砸向地面。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1939
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_a5fb6b7b:

    # "He stops himself shoving it back into his pocket."
    "然后停住自己，并把手机塞回口袋。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1942
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_ffcf81fe:

    # narrator Concerned "Arthur finishes his call and wraps his arms around his bari. Protecting it like it's the last person who knows him."
    narrator Concerned "Arthur打完电话，用手臂环住他的上低音萨克斯风。活像在保护最后一个认识他的人似的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1943
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_11e534b3:

    # "They both look at me and give a sympathetic look."
    "他们两个投来同病相怜的目光。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1946
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_5bc53485:

    # arthur "S-So... I'm gonna take a guess, and correct me if I'm wrong, but no one you called knew who you were?"
    arthur "所、所以……要是我猜错的话就说一下，但你们找的人全都不认识你们对吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1950
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_4de0e9a3:

    # "Rocco nods his head."
    "Rocco点点头。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1953
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_507b1fd5:

    # sean "What do you mean no one knew who you were?"
    sean "什么叫全都不认识你们？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1956
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_67b0b5be:

    # rocco "Sean did you not try to contact anyone in town?"
    rocco "Sean，你没联络镇上的人吗？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1959
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_dcaae4df:

    # "I shake my head no."
    "我摇头表示没有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1962
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_d524029e:

    # arthur "I-I called my folk... T-They told me they don't h-have-a... daughter..."
    arthur "我、我打给我爸妈……他、他们说他们没有……女儿……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1966
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_98928a00:

    # rocco "Hank thought I was a prank caller, my folks told me their only son was taken by the devil, and everyone else just hung up on me."
    rocco "Hank以为我是恶作剧电话；我爸妈说他们唯一的儿子被魔鬼带走了；其他人都直接挂断。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1967
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_6da49f97:

    # rocco "Hell I even tried Claire, and the bitch told me to suck a cock."
    rocco "靠，我甚至打给了Claire，那婊子叫我去吸屌。"

