translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_a160e53c:

    # "Rocco gives me an I told you so look."
    "Rocco用眼神表示「我就说吧」。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:1999
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_1fa3442a:

    # sean Neutral "Look they said to stay put. Apparently everyone within a 100 mile radius of Carthage is down in this damn hole looking for people."
    sean Neutral "好啦，他们要我们待在原地。迦太基方圆一百英里内的所有人，好像都在这天杀的坑里找人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:2002
translate Schinese sean12202024kcp2_cd66431d:

